title: cobynye_wrong
location: ballroom
---

Coby: Oh… Whats this for? 
You hand him the box. Everything seems to be OK until you realize you gave him the wrong box. Color drains from your face as Coby opens it. You freeze, unable to snatch it away.
Coby: Oh… Erm, I don’t think this is for me. Let me reseal it for you. 
You put your face in your hands and groan. That could have gone so much better. This is what you get for buying all your gift boxes and wrapping paper for two for one at the local one berry store.
<<jump cobynye_intro>>
===

title: cobynye_confess
location: ballroom
---

You come back inside with a red face, maybe a bit teary. Nothing like some sobering humiliation to start the evening out. At least, you can calm down a bit. No such luck though, since Coby intercepts you. 
Coby: Are you OK?
-> Yes.
       Coby: Let me get a drink. You don’t look fine.
-> No.
       Coby: Ah, let me get you some water.
He disappears and returns with a glass of water, which he hands you, looking nervous. You wipe your face off and find him staring at you, expression soft.
Coby: I know this is a bad time, but… I really like you, like, like like you. I… Just know I’m here, no matter what the answer is.
-> Accept Coby's feelings
       {$name}: Yes, I'd enjoy spending the evening with you though I may be a bit drunk. Sorry.
       Coby: Well, I’m glad. Means I can look after you the rest of the evening.
       After the failure from earlier, his confession feels incredibly warm. Plus Coby is one of the nicest people you know. As much as this evening ended on a sore spot, at least you got this in the end.
       <<jump cobynye_end>>
-> Reject Coby's feelings
       {$name}: I’m so sorry, but no.
       Coby: That’s fine, you just had a rough time. I’ll still be here for you.
       You go get drinks together, and it's not so bad after all. 
       <<jump cobynye_end>>
===

title: cobynye_end
location: ballroom
---

Wow what a crazy year its been! Who knows what next year will bring.
You smile and watch the New Years Eve fireworks.
===